meta {
  name: Download capacity evaluation
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/capacity-building/download/capacityevaluation
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download Capacity Building Evaluation (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `capacity_building_evaluation` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts them to CSV using `json2csv` in the controller layer. The response is sent directly as a `text/csv` attachment — this endpoint does **not** return JSON.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="capacity_building_evaluation.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per evaluation record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `programName` | Name of the capacity building programme |
  | `programType` | Type/category of the programme |
  | `programDate` | Date the programme was held |
  | `location` | Venue/location of the programme |
  | `programCoordinator` | Name of the programme coordinator |
  | `numberOfSponsors` | Number of sponsors involved |
  | `listOfSponsors` | Names of sponsors |
  | `sponsorshipType` | Type of sponsorship received |
  | `partnerOrganizations` | Partner organisations involved |
  | `partnershipLevel` | Level of partnership |
  | `numberOfParticipants` | Total number of participants |
  | `targetAudience` | Intended target audience |
  | `numberOfFacilitators` | Number of facilitators |
  | `numberOfVolunteers` | Number of volunteers involved |
  | `participantEngagementLevel` | Level of participant engagement |
  | `programObjectives` | Stated programme objectives |
  | `objectiveAchievement` | Whether objectives were achieved |
  | `programOutcome` | Summary of programme outcomes |
  | `programImpact` | Assessment of programme impact |
  | `majorActivities` | Major activities conducted |
  | `effectiveActivities` | Most effective activities |
  | `venueSuitability` | Suitability rating of the venue |
  | `timeManagement` | Time management assessment |
  | `resourceAvailability` | Availability of resources |
  | `communicationAndCoordination` | Communication and coordination quality |
  | `teamworkAmongOrganizers` | Teamwork among organisers |
  | `challengesEncountered` | Challenges encountered during the programme |
  | `challengesAddressed` | How challenges were addressed |
  | `lessonsLearned` | Key lessons learned |
  | `budgetAllocated` | Budget allocated for the programme |
  | `budgetUtilized` | Actual budget utilised |
  | `wereResourcesAdequate` | Whether resources were adequate |
  | `inadequateResourcesExplanation` | Explanation if resources were inadequate |
  | `overallSuccess` | Overall success rating |
  | `recommendTheProgram` | Whether evaluator recommends the programme |
  | `improvementSuggestions` | Suggestions for improvement |
  | `recommendFuturePrograms` | Recommended future programmes |
  | `name` | Name of the evaluator/submitter |
  | `role` | Role of the evaluator/submitter |
  | `dateSubmitted` | Date the evaluation was submitted |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
